(`bg_pos`), and that the RN background satisfies **all seven** frozen PaperBVP relations with
constants `(Q, 0)` at every `R` with `R ≠ 0`, `N0 R ≠ 0` (`bg_F`, `bg_M`, `bg_C`, `bg_q`, `bg_ell`), and on `I`
